=AdoeW8cEskmNiayZEUokDjZNespgQ2Eg14f9yDZmY55MreI_2bu-8e2Q40X4ZN4jJVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKEQ7scz9SsMjUf-6NmDc3PH4JPLwIm18Tj1rDWzDIF6w&oe=6AA408D7"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UxC_rehNzOgQ7kNvwFRX5PO&_nc_oc=AdpwtQCQW0Cl4RA_0B7Qx929FMcXVEpjEQBlH-1v4kEH0NxDDTAbmWIxlRrwx3uTTk0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLliOGYPbRqAuQZshpG8k0Ov6FGZu1IyuinEHCIVqy-pQ&oe=6AA406E1"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WOCfoteBe4MQ7kNvwFn0PA6&_nc_oc=AdqhArD8jFKOUChIqiSJJYd-NvtYIgqYOGQImwknSrS47Gldxb3Y6F1YdzP1g0Byuhs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLH8Gkvtcyvn46Kd8bth7byL35iQTttOoryQKdAyC60iw&oe=6AA3F517"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rW3Eg4Q46w8Q7kNvwEvoB3i&_nc_oc=Adqk5lHq7-BoilMoIpzzjSW54wkgsWWI2LHUjhhqBFSEi8M89c1UxJbYLrCFBMIrrUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJvycPmx33XAqLs4jsvM42C881nsAhxmigGhRD33Xn-eg&oe=6AA3FBA2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v3-kGbb2-6UQ7kNvwEMcdlC&_nc_oc=Adp2LDl5axySZTaq9c1Av0prTqPX2LSiA_VVG9k3Ed7TcbNb1Bhh4pOpMJgT7YY6vZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL_INqcIzWh-WZugOri2pmhvsQZH2ksYXAxKB5w0_zk4g&oe=6AA4202E"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_